- convert any hardcoded px values when applying a visual design to design tokens found in the design system 'ng-zoro'

# Components
- Use ng-zorro components from the design system first when creating new components.

- Use components from this existing set in the project when creating components if ng-zorro is not applicable:
AppointmentCalendar - Calendar view (month/year) component
AppointmentCard - Individual appointment card for planner view
AppointmentLegend - Color legend for appointment categories
AppointmentModal - Modal dialog for creating/editing appointments
CalendarPage - Main calendar page with controls and views
OfflineBanner - Banner shown when offline
PlannerView - Chronological list view of appointments
SyncStatusIndicator - Shows sync status and pending operations